//===- KernelAPIs.def - Supported kernel API contracts --------------------===//
//
// NeverD Decompiler
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
///
/// \file
/// Modeled kernel routine identifiers, exact argument counts, and default
/// export availability. Export entries seed the scenario inventory; Helper
/// entries require an explicit declaration or static import to establish
/// availability. The symbol also generates its spelling and dispatch
/// identifier.
///
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

